# Pass "incompat-original": the original mod this one declares itself incompatible with, alone beside it.
#
# andery233xj.AncientChineseBeast, Workshop 3292446841 - "Ancient Chinese Beast And Gene Expanded" by
# andery233xj, Frolg, DongFang and Ninedaylongbow, last supporting 1.5. About.xml names it in
# incompatibleWith because the two define the same defs. RimWorld does not refuse two mods that do: it
# keeps the later one's copy of each def. This pass stages both and plays 13-original-mod-incompatibility,
# which asserts that symptom, so a green run says the incompatibility is still true.
#
# The item has to be in the WSL install's Workshop cache before this pass can stage it. That is a
# download, so it goes through Use-Wsl.ps1 like any other work on the machine (see
# PickleTools/Headless/README.md, "The lock is about the machine"). It has not been downloaded.
andery233xj.AncientChineseBeast   3292446841
